  <h4>Loads</h4>
  <p>Characteristic uniform loads</p>
  <p>
   Self weight -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>g</var>
    <sub>sw</sub>
    = 25
    <span class="dvc">
     <i>kN</i>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <i>m</i>
     <sup class="unit">3</sup>
    </span>
    ·
    <var>h</var>
    = 25
    <span class="dvc">
     <i>kN</i>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <i>m</i>
     <sup class="unit">3</sup>
    </span>
    · 14
    <i>cm</i>
    = 3.5
    <i>kN</i>
    <i class="unit">∕</i>
    <i>m</i>
    <sup class="unit">2</sup>
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Permanent -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>g</var>
    <sub>k</sub>
    = 2.5
    <span class="dvc">
     <i>kN</i>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <i>m</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
    </span>
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Variable -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>q</var>
    <sub>k</sub>
    = 2
    <span class="dvc">
     <i>kN</i>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <i>m</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
    </span>
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Partial safety factor -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>γ</var>
    <sub>G</sub>
    = 1.35
   </span>
   ;
   <span class="eq">
    <var>γ</var>
    <sub>Q</sub>
    = 1.5
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>Design uniform loads</p>
  <p>
   <span class="eq">
    <var>p</var>
    =  (
    <var>g</var>
    <sub>sw</sub>
    +
    <var>g</var>
    <sub>k</sub>
    )  ·
