  <h4>Material properties</h4>
  <p>
   <b>Concrete</b>
   [EN 1992-1-1, Table 3.1]
  </p>
  <p>
   Characteristic compressive cylinder strength -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>f</var>
    <sub>ck</sub>
    = 25
    <i>MPa</i>
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Partial safety factor for concrete -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>γ</var>
    <sub>c</sub>
    = 1.5
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Long-term effects coefficient -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>α</var>
    <sub>cc</sub>
    = 0.85
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Design compressive cylinder strength -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>f</var>
    <sub>cd</sub>
    =
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>α</var>
     <sub>cc</sub>
     ·
     <var>f</var>
     <sub>ck</sub>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>γ</var>
     <sub>c</sub>
    </span>
    =
    <span class="dvc">
     0.85 · 25
     <i>MPa</i>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     1.5
    </span>
    = 14.17
    <i>MPa</i>
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Factor defining the effective height of the compression zone -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>λ</var>
    = 0.8
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Factor defining the effective strength -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>η</var>
    = 1
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   Mean value of axial tensile strength -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>f</var>
    <sub>ctm</sub>
    = 0.3 ·
    <span class="b1">(</span>
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>f</var>
     <sub>ck</sub>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     1
     <i>MPa</i>
    </span>
    <span class="b1">)</span>
    <sup class="raised">
     <span class="dvc">
      2
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
    </sup>
    · 1
    <i>MPa</i>
    = 0.3 ·
    <span class="b1">(</span>
    <span class="dvc">
     25
     <i>MPa</i>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     1
     <i>MPa</i>
    </span>
    <span class="b1">)</span>
    <sup class="raised">
     <span class="dvc">
      2
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
    </sup>
    · 1
    <i>MPa</i>
    = 2.56
    <i>MPa</i>
   </span>
  </p>
  <p>
   <b>Steel</b>
  </p>
  <p>
   Characteristic yield strength -
   <span class="eq">
    <var>f</var>
